  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the support is to facilitate an effective national response to the Hiv/Aids challenges in Honduras by supporting community initiatives and building local capacity. This is done by the Forum&apos;s Technical support unit and by the regional Chapters established around the country.</narrative>
